  "avatar": "data:image/png;base64,",
  "description": "Ed Felten is Co-founder and Chief Scientist at Offchain Labs, the original developers of Arbitrum. He was previously a professor at Princeton University, and served in the White House as Deputy U.S. Chief Technology Officer. He is a member of the U.S. National Academy of Sciences and the American Academy of Arts and Sciences, and a Fellow of the ACM."
